  "history": [],
  "facts": [
    "The Witch Golem is one of four temporary troops introduced in the Mashup Madness event for Clash-o-Ween 2023, where it could be unlocked after accumulating 55,000 Sour Elixir in the event. It returned in the Mashup Mania event for Clash-o-Ween 2024, where it can be unlocked with 3,000 Sour Elixir."
  ],
